  "details": "Report and moderation inside the platform is a must have, creating a more user firendly system for in game reporting would be nice, instead of buttons to choose allow the user to type in their report with say a max of 50 to 100 words, this will allow users to report underage children, pedos, online bullies, crashers, and so much more, having a team to look after these reports outside the game would be nice, then set the report to the account, once three reports have been made send the reports and account name to an in game moderation team member to investigate the user, a system like or if not similar would be very good for this type of platform.",
